WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Open the Transfer files workspace.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.400 line:59%
Select release-bundle.zip on the left and click Upload.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.400 line:59%
Check the upload progress and pause it in the queue.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.100 line:59%
Resume the upload. The file appears on the server when it completes.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:16.000 line:59%
Select server-logs.zip on the right and click Download.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.300 line:59%
Follow the download progress in the transfer queue.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.160 line:59%
Both transfers are complete. The downloaded file appears on the left.
